# Day-to-day: cache-aside read path: hit/miss branch and write-back; reciprocal app<->cache and app<->db.
title "Cache-aside"
dir DOWN
app[Application] :purple
hit{Cache hit?} :yellow
cache[(Cache)] :orange
db[(Database)] :teal
app -> cache : GET key
cache -> hit : value or nil
hit -> app : hit, return
hit -> db : miss, query
db -> app : row
app -> cache : SET key
